# Regenerable 600-dpi rasters for the panels the scripts rebuild (Fig 2d/2e,
# 5d, 6c). The PDF and SVG in the same folder are the real deliverables; these
# PNGs are just a convenience export and are recreated on every run.
fig2/*.png
fig5/mat1a_gly336arg_*.png
fig6/alox15b_rs9895916_*.png

# Deliberately NOT ignored:
#   _validation/*.png        evidence images, not regenerated by the scripts
#   _reference_current/*.png the "before" panels extracted from the manuscript
#   fig5/fig5b*, fig5/fig5c*, fig7/*, fig8/*   finished vector panels; some are
#                            no longer rebuildable (Ensembl 115 archive is 403)
